sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant T as Triage Agent
    participant B as Backend Agent
    participant S as Shared State Store
    participant R as Reviewer Agent

    C->>T: Assign incident triage
    T->>S: write incident.summary expected_version=None
    S-->>T: applied version=1
    C->>B: Request backend diagnosis with snapshot
    B->>S: write incident.root_cause expected_version=None
    S-->>B: applied version=1
    B->>S: write incident.summary expected_version=0
    S-->>B: conflict current_version=1
    C->>S: create_handoff(keys)
    S-->>C: filtered context
    C->>R: Review minimal handoff
